        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We apply decades of experience in materials characterization, failure analysis, and product development to evaluate how materials respond to mechanical, chemical, thermal, and environmental stresses.",
